WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.600
Before changing query.py, trace what depends on it.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.100
Direct and transitive relationships, resolved from the scan.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.100
No LLM in the deterministic scan.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.900
The output becomes reusable evidence for the next steps.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:24.433
A file, a symbol, a line range, and the actual source.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:28.133
A target selects this file’s ownership.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:34.133
A changed file can affect more than its immediate importers.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:37.133
_launcher.py → cli.py → query.py

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.367
dashboard.py → mcp_server.py → query.py

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:44.867
Eight candidates from direct imports or naming matches.

00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:48.733
Candidates guide investigation. They do not prove test coverage.

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:53.733
Configure the client. Request targeted repository evidence.

00:00:53.733 --> 00:00:59.983
The tool returns source with its file and line range.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.500
A dependency graph appears in the PR.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Trace the changed file to its dependents.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.500
A real review flagged a count-parsing regression.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.100
Real screenshots from public Aletheore reviews.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.500
Hosted features add architecture pages and AI-marked symbol documentation.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:27.200
Monitoring can connect an endpoint back to its source handler.

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:31.833
Scan → source → dependents → candidate tests → agent → PR review.

00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:34.833
Free local scanner · Python 3.11–3.14 · pipx required
